# Abbreviation ratchet (PR #1188, R1188-U4: names are full English words).
#
# The ceilings on abbreviated names in code, measured by
# scripts/measure-abbreviations.mjs over the scopes of
# data/meta/abbreviation-rules.lino (gate check-abbreviations), with the
# abbreviation list of data/meta/notation-rules.lino. A file counts once when a
# word of its stem is on the list; a binding counts once per declaration. A new
# abbreviated file name or declaration raises a count and fails the gate; the
# ceilings only fall: `--write` lowers them to the measure after a rename pass.
#
# History. Recorded on 2026-10-08 after tree file-names-in-full-words of
# data/meta/rename-map.lino spelled twelve file names in full words
# (formal_ai_worker_nl_tools is formal_ai_worker_natural_language_tools).
abbreviation-ratchet
  file-names
    abbreviated-file-names 92
  bindings js
    abbreviated-bindings 727
  bindings rust/src
    abbreviated-bindings 912
